{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_05_end","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-5","storyName":"双飞燕","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"百灶改建，疑云暗涌，书刀不翼而飞。寻觅之际，椿得悉颉的力量与日俱增的事实。与此同时，百灶的改建凭空出现重重困难，大炎与代理人间的嫌隙已悄然出现。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["望","均","颉","梁","年","工部官员","工部尚书","疑虑的工部官员","着急的工部官员","司岁台监正","椿","礼部官员","真龙"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"animtext","id":6,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>965年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":7},{"type":"animtextclean","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"……情况我清楚了。","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这件事绝对不可让旁人知晓，要额外当心。","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你还得再帮我，去做一件事。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":16,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"大理寺已经开始追查书刀失窃的时间前后，所有接近过天镜阁的人了。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"除了我们兄弟姐妹，整个大炎知道有这柄书刀存在的，不超过一手之数。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#19$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"是啊，和我担忧的一点不差。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"颉，如果有人想对你不利，我不会坐视不管。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"……如果真的想伤害我的话，也不会用这种手段了。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"所以我猜，这更多是一种警告吧。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"……","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"那位陛下是有为之君，他想要所有“人”对他俯首称臣。在他看来，我们一家的确是“非我族类”了。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"不过我倒是相信，以他的品格，应当不齿于用这柄书刀做些苟且之事。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"可这对你未免过分了。你明明是最不该被猜忌的那一个。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"没有人会比二姐更清楚，“公正”二字，究竟有多么难写。就像大哥说过的……众口铄金，辩驳无用。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"如果他此刻就在这里，不见得会善罢甘休。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"噗嗤……","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我可不想再见到大哥生气的样子，真是太可怕啦。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"那你准备怎么办？这件事，你也不打算告诉望？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"我倒是觉得，他的能耐这种时候反而能派上用场。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"颉轻轻摇了摇头。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我正要拜托二姐……这件事，务必要对二哥他保密。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"……","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"这么多年来，二哥始终因为各种原因被人所忌惮，新君临朝以来，他的处境更为微妙。这种时候，绝对不该再将他牵扯进来。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"更何况，要是让他知道了，我只怕按他的脾气，指不定会做出什么不理智的事呢。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"好，姑且随你的意。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"可是，颉，我也希望你能对我坦诚。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#19$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"你究竟有没有与望一同筹谋什么？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"好姐姐，别审我啦。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"……","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"唉，在你面前果真没人能撒得了谎。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#19$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"果然。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2126_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"均","text":"颉，你应当清楚，你在使用的这一份力量很危险。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_2126_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我当然知道这是一件有风险的事，可是这么多年来，承担着风险的也不止我一人。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"大哥二哥，还有大姐与你，都为我们这些弟弟妹妹做了许多事，我也不能无动于衷。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"再怎么说，我也不想让自己精心为大家取的这些名字……在历史上消弭无踪啊。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-20,0","duration":"0.5","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"15,0","duration":"0.5","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"见眼前的人依旧愁眉不展，颉轻轻牵起了均的手。这只常年操弄乐器的手掌心粗糙，握在手中的感觉却令人安心。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"你看，我这不还是好端端地待在这里？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"放心吧……","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"其实，我最近做了一个梦，关于我们未来的梦。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"和黍描述的那一片雪白不同……我看到的是一个不一样的未来。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我看到了你们每个人，每个人，都可以真正作为自己而活着。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"梦中的画面是那样真实，完全不像是一场梦。我甚至有一种预感……","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我不觉得，那只是一场梦……","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":100},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":103},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_bg_63_mini04_mountaintop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":107,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"年姑娘，好久不见。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"哟，圆脑袋。怎么监工的是你呀？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"你家包工头呢？又跑哪里去偷懒了？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"年姑娘误会了，自从得知百灶要改成移动城市，先生便为了城市的设计操劳起来，最忙的时候，整整有一个月不曾合眼。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"嚯，那个慢性子还有这么上心的时候？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"先生说，这是炎国的第一座移动城市，意义非凡。留在城市中的每一笔设计，都需要深思熟虑。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"因此，必须要赶在年姑娘对他的设计动手之前，抢先一步完成。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"唉我——！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"臭老八，亏我还总是惦记着和他分享点好东西，他在背后就这样说我坏话？！","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"那他现在人在哪？我倒要和他理论理论——","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"在补觉。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"先生已经睡了十天了，但是按着与工部的约定，今天是要给工部交付正门设计稿的日子。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"他交代过我，今天无论如何也要把工部的人拦在外面。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"哈哈哈……！我就知道，这才是我认识的那个易嘛。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"……","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"还有什么事吗？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"你是说，易这会还在睡大觉……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"我突然想起来，几十年前，易他好像捡了一块陨铁来着……应该还留在他的园子里吧，放在哪里了？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"年姑娘……我有先生交代的任务在身。今天无论是工部的官员还是你，在下都不能放进界园。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"你怎么这么听他的话？细算起来，给你打造这副身体的材料还是我给他的，按理说你也得听我的话。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"少说废话，快点让开！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1870_1#1$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁","text":"年姑娘，还是万万不可……请不要让在下为难——","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1870_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部官员","text":"梁先生，年小姐，侍郎紧急请二位前去禁城议事。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1630_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"嗯？议事就议事，有多紧急？","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":160,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部官员","text":"百灶城的工程，遇到了一些问题……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1630_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部官员","text":"本来要运到百灶城中的，当下急缺的一批物资，包括异铁源石等物，纷纷卡在了路上。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1630_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部官员","text":"现在后头的工程……一团乱麻。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1630_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"搞什么……","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年","text":"工部那些老头子，到底能不能行？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avgnew_2014_nian_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":171},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowl_smash","id":175},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部尚书","text":"怎么搞的……到底是怎么搞的？！","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部尚书","text":"百灶城动工是天大的事，怎么还能出这种岔子？！","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部尚书","text":"京城附近的驰道修缮向来完备，又不是碰上了天灾，怎么会平白无故地塌陷？如此靠近京城的地方，又何来匪患？！","id":179},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑虑的工部官员","text":"大人……要说起来，这几件事实在是太过蹊跷。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑虑的工部官员","text":"突然发生的塌方，还有莫名其妙消失，又从不该出现的地方出现的物资……","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑虑的工部官员","text":"如果这些事背后的确有人在操纵，那此人的目的，应当在惑乱人心。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑虑的工部官员","text":"事实上，最近城中已经能听到不少流言。许多工人都相信，百灶城在此刻动工是犯了凶时。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部尚书","text":"有人故意要扰乱人心？能是什么人？","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1633_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"着急的工部官员","text":"尚书大人，礼部尚书求见。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1633_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工部尚书","text":"礼部？这个时候找上门来干什么，要看我工部的笑话？","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1633_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"着急的工部官员","text":"回大人，礼部尚书说，知道工部最近事务繁杂，可眼下的麻烦，牵扯到的不只是工部……","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1633_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_bg_47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"椿，你来了。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"知道找你是有什么事吗？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#4$2","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"大概是……书刀相关。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"嗯。","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"在你看来，现在这事陷入两难，应该如何解决？","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我想，若是监正大人……能替她美言几句，将她的书刀物归原主……","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"呵。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"你接着说。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"若真想更改数字，只要绕过她便是，又何必……闹到这一步呢？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"真有意思，她的上一个秉烛人，被弹劾“与代理人关系密切”，之后才告老还乡……她的确有服人之能啊。","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"她……不，代理人的确有各自的怪脾气，可他们从未想过要对大炎有任何不利——","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"只要不主动对大炎不利，其他人的怪脾气，我们的确可以容忍。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"但她……","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"你至少应当清楚，你是在与什么样的存在打交道，她的权能，对炎国来说究竟意味着什么。","id":233},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"监正把那份至今尚未呈递的文件甩在椿的面前，又把一支沾了墨的笔递给她。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"请试试吧。","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"既然你认为可以绕过那代理人，那就试试。把这份文件上的数字改成你喜欢的样子。","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_58_g5_dragonpalace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼部官员","text":"陛下……关于百灶工程物资受损的事，礼部工部已经协同调查完毕。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼部官员","text":"参与调查的人员一致相信，这一系列事故极有可能是人为造成，而且……应当有一个幕后主使。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼部官员","text":"那些物资如今已陆续送达百灶，耽误的工程进度，工部会努力赶上……","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"为何话说一半？","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"你们既然怀疑有幕后主使，那总该有个怀疑对象才对？","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼部官员","text":"……","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"紧张的官员不敢直视帷幕后的身影，只是余光瞥见，那位至尊之人正站在书桌前，提笔写些什么。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"这是都挑准了时机来向我下战书啊。","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"一个告诉我她才是大炎的喉舌，另一个只要稍施手段，就能阻挠大炎偌大的工程，工程想要顺利继续，还是需要由他首肯。","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"那是不是有朝一日，只要愿意，他们俩也能让大炎的军队倒戈？","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"礼部官员","text":"陛下，兹事体大。如果真的是代理人为祸，应当立即责令司岁台对其严加惩办。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"……","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"不必急躁。","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"沉吟半晌，帷幕后的身影放下了手中的毛笔。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"知道这练字是长久的功夫，可不知为何，总觉得怎么也不见功夫……","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"不过倒是明白了一点，以前太师为什么非要我花这么多时间在这上面。","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"还是要沉得住气才行。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"青年真龙端详着面前宣纸上的墨迹，似乎是横竖看来都不满意，又锁紧了眉头。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"今夜明月人尽望","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrapebook_quick","volume":"1","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"他拿起手边的书刀，刮去了那个惹眼的“望”字……","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"只一瞬，纸面又变得洁白如初。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"他妹妹迂腐，他自己倒是个聪明人，还知道让物资运抵百灶，做一些表面功夫。","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"既然他要为妹妹鸣不平，我就成全他的兄妹情。那个数字随他们去便是。","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"至于这东西……","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"本来的确想过，要用这柄书刀做点儿什么……","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"罢了，还回去吧。","id":278},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":279},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":286},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":287,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","duration":"1","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"颉……","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你的东西，司岁台已经寻回来了。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"……","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"多谢你了。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"颉，实在抱歉……","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"你帮我找回了我丢失的东西，怎么还反而要向我道歉。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"没有关系，物归原主就好。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"发生了这样的事，到底是我的失职。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"……颉，其实，我一直想问你。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你说你不愿用书刀删削历史，这几年下来，就连错别字你都不愿用它改。那你一直留着这柄书刀，究竟想要做什么？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"忘了吗？这个问题，你刚来三个月的时候就问过我。当时我不许你用书刀改错，你还埋怨我来着。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"是、是吗……我，我有点记不清了。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"现在关于衍兽精灵的记载终于被修正了，你就把当年的初心给忘了？","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"不，我只是……","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"听好。往者不可追是事实，但，就像你我所做的一样，这并不意味着我们要对过去的错误视若无睹，甚至文过饰非。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我留下这柄书刀，只是为了让人们记得，我们总还有修正错误的机会。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"嗯……我明白。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.7","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":326},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_bg_47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"一个字都改不掉……被破坏的书页，被勾掉的字迹，都会立刻恢复原状——怎么会这样？！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$2","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"怎么会这样？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"你看到了，这便是她的权能。","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"一百多年前，她还并未如此难缠，那时已经有有识之士提出，应请她离开太史阁，避免让她直接撰史。","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"她本人并无怨言，主动转到天镜阁做审校的工作，学宫的课程也减了不少，更多作为顾问出现，就像她二姐一样。","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"可她那过目不忘的本事，执着于历史的坚持，还有悠长的寿命，对史家而言，实在是个太大的诱惑。","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"不知怎的，所有人都等着那个从不出错的人首肯，她也乐意承担更多的工作，经手更多的档案和史料……","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"终于，到了今天，经过她手的史册文章，只要她不愿意，便无人能够修改。","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#12$2","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"……","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"至于你心心念念的书刀……颉第一次拿起这柄刀的时候，它只是一柄再普通不过的书刀。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"数百年之后，当这柄刀已经成了颉贴身的私物，它就不必再削刮竹简，也能修改字迹了。","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"又过了二百年，这柄书刀曾经误删了一代真龙实录上的一页。","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"那本实录平时无人翻阅，亲历者也都已故去。于是，一个冒失的史官轻轻一划，那一页上记了什么，再没人想得起来。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"那固然是因为实录都是孤本，可颉的能力逐年强大，也是事实。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"此时此刻，若是司岁台或者颉自己要用那柄书刀，为天下削去一字、一句，甚至一段记忆……这可不是痴人说梦。","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"这书刀不过沾染了些许颉的力量，而颉本人的力量究竟在以何种速度膨胀，不用我多说。","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"大炎的历史越是厚重，与历史同生的她，也将越发难以制约。","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司岁台监正","text":"再过个百年千年，如果她仍像现在这样浸淫于历史之中，她恐怕会成为比岁兽本身，都更加强大、更加恐怖的力量。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"长生的秉烛人怔怔地站在原地，不敢相信自己刚刚听见了什么。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.7","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#12$2","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":360},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"已经没事了，那我便先回天镜阁了。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"嗯，路上小心。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥……？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你还好么……","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"无事。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥，你果然还是……","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"……","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":386},{"type":"text","text":"二人沉默着，在二人相处的很长一段时间里，他们已经习惯了彼此间默契的沉默。","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"而颉在此时，也分明读懂了身边人眼中的情绪。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"一丝不曾流露的怒火。","id":389},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":390},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_bg_70_g7_suilingcore.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":397},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14mini/m_sys_act14mini_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":398,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这是一百多年前的旧事，我记得那一次与炎国因为那柄书刀而起的争端。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这一次，你想让我看的又是什么？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我还以为，你会在某个时刻鲁莽地闯入这段梦境，将其撕碎。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":405},{"type":"subtitle","text":"自诩善谋的你难道看不清，你们的结局，如何在那时埋下祸根？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":406},{"type":"subtitle","text":"人心向背……","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":407},{"type":"subtitle","id":408},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"……这不用你提醒。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"原来当年你并未插手我和那条真龙之间的角力。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你知道了，又当如何？自掘坟墓的是你自己，用不着我做什么。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":415},{"type":"subtitle","text":"更何况，当年那件事究竟如何引向她最终的死亡，你还远未看全。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":416},{"type":"subtitle","text":"已经临近终局，你做好准备了吗？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":417},{"type":"subtitle","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":420},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"bgeffect","id":422},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":423},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":424},{"type":"image","id":425},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":426}],"characters":["望","均","颉","梁","年","工部官员","工部尚书","疑虑的工部官员","着急的工部官员","司岁台监正","椿","礼部官员","真龙"]}